{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"fbf377692846def1cd4ebedb57234133ee27b2140aae4413f25106dcb1b883b1","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"106a9266395182264f94821da0182c6af7069a7ba39a6dfb5f099c3d8293045e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"1bf82bee092e1a6b0b1953441243ba34037b0a6bae405621b9f6cef52f811d59","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义偏移（tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua:1904）：原文“Your former enemies will be freshly grown trees”的意思是敌人本身变成新长出的树，“former”暗示他们已不再是敌人；译文“你的敌人体内将会长出一棵树”改成了体内长树，并丢掉了 former。另外“even quicker than ever”被弱化为“更快的”，句中“的”应作“地”。"},{"revision_key":"4d968f8856038f15760767889ec40a02ba025bb59b6e1023232b3b18e336a4a0","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"误译（world-artifacts.lua:313）：“a tendency towards overkill”指火力/杀伤过度、下手过重。同条 special_desc 写的是“Knocks you back when fired.”，即开火时后坐力把自己击退，正与火力过猛呼应。译文“滥杀”意为滥杀无辜，语义错误，建议改为“以火力过猛/下手过狠而闻名”。"},{"revision_key":"4e24ac36b0ae7ecdc378883d644d22b99608ff2a0426f1aa23317d60b90dc30d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4e9cf35b9fa279ba32f3da6fc8060309a95e08af9619bf6322b692e094247668","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义偏移（tome-orcs/data/zones/slumbering-caves/npcs.lua:220）：原文“You do not know why but this cannot happen”是说你说不出缘由，但直觉认定这件事绝不能发生。译文“你不知道他为什么要这么做”把“不知道的原因”错置为祭司复活阿马克泰尔的动机。"},{"revision_key":"4f11cda37affbb7f24bc8fdc593b4daf5245d153ead3d66ed1a1009fd3bd89b5","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/palace-fumes.lua:100/110 有两处问题。(1) PALAQUIE 所说“Neither can afford direct intervention”的主语是前句想消灭或想监禁克鲁克兽人的两派小个子（半身人），意为他们都承担不起直接介入；译文“不论是那种，我们都没法直接介入”把主语错改成了蒸汽议会自己，而且“那种”应为“哪种”。(2) “those filthy little greenskins”中的 filthy 意为肮脏，被误译为“狡猾的小绿人们”。"},{"revision_key":"4fd92b37748e32190fbcc257e59ec53537ef92422e74dac53dbb11d75098604b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4fdf57500643a23b17e33a139d931cabe354d99bfda8809494412710a1302cbe","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"5083f958aa8cc526aea56dc751f9eef981c163ddb0cacfa5627fcd915a65da80","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"信息缺失（tome-orcs/data/chats/kruk-tinker-shop.lua:33）：原文括号内明确给出所授技能类别“talent category Steamtech/Physics and Steamtech/Chemistry”，这是告诉玩家将解锁哪两个技能树的机制信息。译文只写“物理学或者化学知识”，删掉了“技能类别”和 Steamtech 前缀，玩家无法对应到技能树。"},{"revision_key":"50e25e6b3831639939cd7dfb93d61a8818a538f92e379322aab7a575c7c5cb41","verdict":"OK"}]}